  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">裝甲強敵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓更多生物穿著並顯示盔甲，讓 Minecraft 的敵人變得更難且更具沉浸感。村民、女巫和所有類型的惡魔現在都會像玩家一樣顯示它們裝備的盔甲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這個模組還為某些生物添加了自然生成的盔甲，使它們更加多樣化和有挑戰性。喪屍可以在普通盔甲中出現，豬人在黃金盔甲中出現，而惡魔在襲擊期間會裝備盔甲。一切都完全基於數據驅動，並且可以通過戰利品表和條件輕鬆調整。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可見的盔甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">女巫、村民和惡魔現在會顯示它們所穿的盔甲。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自然盔甲生成：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">喪屍和凋零骷髏可以像僵尸和骷髏一樣生成帶有盔甲的版本。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">金色豬人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豬人、猪灵暴徒和僵尸豬人出生時穿戴金質盔甲。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">裝甲襲擊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">所有惡魔（包括 vindicator、evoker、pillager 和 illusioner）在襲擊期間都會裝備盔甲。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📜 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">數據驅動的裝備：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用 loot table 和條件規則定義自然生物的裝備。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過數據包輕鬆調整生成機率、盔甲類型和條件。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> CLIENT 和 SERVER 均需安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可以直接在遊戲中使用模組菜單進行配置（需要在 Fabric 上安裝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\">Mod Menu</a>，由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\">Prospector</a> 開發）。請注意，在某些較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\">Forge Config Screens</span> 也是必需的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文本編輯器進行手動配置，所有文件均位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code> 目錄中，命名方式為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>，取決於配置文件類型。並非所有模組都必須包含所有類型的配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/imb11\">IMB11</a> 他們的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armorful\">Armorful</span> 模組，這啟發我開始了這個項目。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/armor-quick-swap\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armorquickswap/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dyed-flames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/airhop/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
